 0B6D   07FE    rules:
 0B70   07FE            CLS
 0B70   07FE            WIDTH 80
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Welcome to the premier point and click game by 
                Kreuzer productions"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " The point and click interface is really quite e
                asy. Move the green"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " cursor onto the object you want to manipulate a
                nd press one of "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " these keys. (a) for action . (l) to look at an 
                object. Type (u) to"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " use th active object. (g) to get that object.(n
                ote) some objects you"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " must look at to get or you must look at the dra
                wer to find the object "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " inside. Also at any time during the game you ma
                y press (i) to display "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " the your inventory ,time and place. Plus you ma
                y load,save or quit"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " or select the active object from this screen. "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " if you seem to be stuck it would be wise to bac
                ktrack and look to see if"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " you anything new has opened up or one of your o
                bjects has a use in that"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " room. If action does not work on something you 
                might try look or get or"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " vice versa, also try clicking the cursor on dif
                ferent parts of the object"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " it might reveal different things. "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Hints: Click (a) on and arrow by the door to le
                ave"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Even though it might seem as if two or more obj
                ects"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " could do the trick, usually only one will work.
                "
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Just to get you started move your cursor by the
                 rug of the first"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " room. Then press (l) it will say you see a lump
                y rug. That didn't help."
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Don't worry, save often you never know what may
                 happen"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " P.S. Time does matter"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " Get ready to journey into the twisting and cont
                orting shadows of"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " your uncle's residence"
 0B70   07FE            PRINT " PRESS ANY KEY TO CONTINUE "
